    "title": "Ravenswood volleyball sets program record with 36 wins in 2025 | Jackson Star and Herald - Ripley and Ravenswood | wvnews.com",
    "text": "RAVENSWOOD, W.Va. — The season for Ravenswood Devilette volleyball was one of several highs.\nStarting with the team's 36 wins, the most in the proud program's history. Ravenswood closed the campaign at 36-14, resulting in the third-best winning percentage ever. The 36 wins marked the third consecutive season Ravenswood has won 30 or more, which ties a school record. Devilette volleyball has been an outstanding 102-38 the last three years.",
